---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about Generator Switch Guide - your trusted resource for transfer switch information, reviews, and buying guides."
>
  <article class="py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About Generator Switch Guide</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="lead text-xl text-gray-600">
          We're dedicated to helping homeowners understand, choose, and install the right transfer switch for their generator backup power needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Power outages are becoming more frequent and longer-lasting. Whether it's severe weather, grid instability, or infrastructure aging, having reliable backup power is no longer a luxury—it's a necessity for many families.
        </p>
        <p>
          Generator Switch Guide was created to demystify the often confusing world of transfer switches. We break down technical jargon, compare products objectively, and provide practical guidance so you can make informed decisions about your home's backup power system.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Educational Guides:</strong> Comprehensive articles explaining transfer switch types, sizing, installation requirements, and code compliance.</li>
          <li><strong>Product Reviews:</strong> Honest, hands-on assessments of popular transfer switches from brands like Generac, Reliance, Siemens, and more.</li>
          <li><strong>Comparison Tools:</strong> Interactive calculators and comparison tables to help you find the right match for your specific needs.</li>
          <li><strong>Installation Guidance:</strong> What to expect from professional installation, DIY considerations, and cost estimates by region.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          We believe in providing accurate, practical information without the sales pressure. Our goal is to educate first—because when you understand your options, you'll naturally make better decisions.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every product recommendation is based on real specifications, verified customer experiences, and industry standards (like NEC code requirements). We don't recommend products we wouldn't install in our own homes.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          Generator Switch Guide participates in affiliate programs, including Amazon Associates. When you purchase through our links, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This helps us maintain the site and continue creating free educational content.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our affiliate relationships never influence our recommendations. We recommend products based on quality, value, and suitability—not commission rates.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          Have questions or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to get in touch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
